OL,3,GNEWSAYoung people say charity is 'like 
OL,4,Afamily'                                
OL,6,F"Moving to the UK was hard. I was shy, 
OL,7,FI couldn't really chat to people," said
OL,8,FPraise Uhunamure, remembering his      
OL,9,Farrival in Newcastle from Italy when he
OL,10,Fwas 10 years old and spoke very little 
OL,11,FEnglish.                               
OL,13,FHe is one of more than 23,000 children 
OL,14,Fwho have been helped by Success4All, a 
OL,15,Fcharity that supports young people who 
OL,16,Ffind themselves at a disadvantage,     
OL,17,Foften because English is not their     
OL,18,Ffirst language.                        
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
