OL,3,GNEWSAYoung people say charity is 'like 
OL,4,Afamily'                                
OL,6,FUhunamure initially signed up to an    
OL,7,Fafter school programme and, now aged 19
OL,8,Fand in his second year at Northumbria  
OL,9,FUniversity, has attended revision      
OL,10,Fsessions and activities like kayaking  
OL,11,Fand podcasting.                        
OL,13,F"Spending 10 years in Italy and        
OL,14,Ftransitioning straight to Newcastle    
OL,15,Fwhere people speak Geordie. I didn't   
OL,16,Freally know much English.              
